## Third-party assets

The AI brand icons bundled in `lib/client.js` come from:

- [@lobehub/icons-static-svg](https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons) 1.98.0 (MIT)
- Official App Store artwork (Apple `artworkUrl512`)
- Public brand assets from vendor websites and official GitHub repositories

Trademarks belong to their respective owners. Icons are used here for
identification purposes only.
